  "description": "New to the Market  \n3 Bedroom Detached Country Bungalow on c.0.72 Acre Site\nIsland Upper, Ballyhaunis, Co. Mayo F35 Y722\n\nGuide Price: €180,000\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers, in conjunction with John Higgins Auctioneers, Ballyhaunis, are delighted to present this 3-bedroom detached country bungalow, set on a generous c.0.80 acre site, ideally located just 2 miles from Ballyhaunis Town Centre and approx. 4 miles from Knock Village.\n\nThis property offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-laid-out family home in a peaceful rural setting, while remaining within easy reach of all amenities and transport links.\n\nAccommodation Comprises:\n\nEntrance Hall:\nTiled floor with timber ceiling.\n\nSitting Room:\nBright living space featuring vaulted timber ceiling, timber flooring and solid fuel stove with stone-effect surround.\n\nKitchen:\nFitted units with tiled floor and tiled splashback.\n\nUtility Room:\nTiled floor, half tiled walls, timber ceiling, plumbed for appliances with PVC door to rear garden.\n\nHotpress:\nConvenient storage.\n\nBedrooms:\n\nBedroom 1: Timber flooring and ceiling\n\nBedroom 2: Timber flooring and ceiling with dual-aspect windows\n\nBedroom 3: Timber flooring and ceiling with fitted curtains\n\nMain Bathroom:\nFully tiled floor and walls, WC, WHB and electric shower (fully tiled).\n\nFeatures Include:\nc.0.72 acre site\nVaulted ceiling in sitting room\n\nTimber ceilings throughout adding character\nTV points in all rooms\n\nFully dry-lined internally\nDouble glazed PVC windows and doors\n\nOil-fired central heating system\nSeptic tank and mains water connected\n\nOutside:\nSpacious site with ample potential\nStorage shed on site\n\nLocation:\n\nApprox. 2 miles to Ballyhaunis Town Centre\n\nApprox. 4 miles to Knock Village\n\nKnock Shrine: approx. 10km\n\nIreland West Airport Knock: approx. 25km\n\nCastlerea & Claremorris: approx. 15–20 mins\n\nRoscommon Town: approx. 44km\nThis is a well-located property with strong potential, offering a solid home base in a convenient rural setting.\n\nViewing is strictly by appointment.\n\nJoint Agents:\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n086 2130723 | 094 9362216\nMIPAV MMCEPI\nPSRA Licence No: 002031\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\n\nJohn Higgins Auctioneers, Ballyhaunis\n094 963 1372\nPSRA Licence No:002467\n\nDisclaimer:\nThese particulars, including measurements, floor areas and property size, are for guidance only and may contain errors. They are not part of any contract. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided.",
